                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "After kicking off my 5th biannual #36CountyTour on February 20th with a town hall in Cherokee, I kept my travels going with a visit to Burgess Health Center in Onawa.\n\nI\u2019ll always work to support our rural hospitals and dedicated healthcare professionals!\nhttps://t.co/0ddAeej3MF",
