                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At the end of March, Medicare coverage of audio-only telehealth expires. \n\nThat's why I'm working with @RepChrisPappas to permanently extend Medicare coverage of over-the-phone telehealth services so that Iowans can receive care from the comfort of their homes. https://t.co/0HYBsUl13k",
