                "text": "Yesterday, I introduced legislation to permanently extend Medicare coverage of audio-only telehealth beyond its March 31 expiration.\n\nTelehealth services ensure that our families, farmers, and seniors can receive high-quality care when they need it.\nhttps://t.co/KntkiQBRKE",
