                "text": "With the enrollment period quickly coming to a close, I encourage #IA04 dairy farmers to sign up for Dairy Margin Coverage (DMC) by the March 31st deadline at their local FSA office.\n\nPlease contact our office by phone at 202-225-4426 if we can be helpful.\nhttps://t.co/9nT15GgZj0",
