                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Ensuring our rural hospitals & healthcare facilities remain open is critical to the health & wellbeing of our families.\n\nI\u2019m glad to support @RepRonnyJackson's bill to codify an important USDA program that provides technical assistance to rural hospitals & healthcare clinics.",
