                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We must make proactive investments in our healthcare infrastructure to reverse the alarming trend of hospital closures in rural areas.\n\nI\u2019m glad to support legislation to help keep rural hospitals open by promoting best practices, financial stability & quality care for patients. https://t.co/hGhqLkJ865",
