                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, we recognize & thank our nation's nurses, especially those in #IA04, for their commitment to our families & communities.\n\nThese incredible Americans work long hours caring for our neighbors & helping patients on the road to recovery.\n\nThank you to these healthcare heroes! https://t.co/0p4AWDEhJv",
