                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As we recognize Alzheimer\u2019s Awareness Month, it was a pleasure to meet with Iowans from the Iowa Alzheimer\u2019s Association.\n\nWith roughly 7 million Americans living with Alzheimer\u2019s, we had an informative conversation about how we can work together to #EndAlz and support patients. https://t.co/qS7gzYBW5W",
