                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 18,
                "retweet_count": 26,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans passed and President Trump signed into law $50 billion for rural hospitals and rural healthcare.\n\nThis historic infusion of resources will improve patient care, support healthcare professionals, and keep our rural hospitals and clinics open and operational.",
